# Build & CI

- GUI builds: `.github/workflows/build_gui.yml` (Windows + macOS matrix)
- Releases: `.github/workflows/release.yml` on `v*.*.*` tags
- Windows today: PyInstaller onedir → zip (`CIBMangoTree_windows.zip`); no MSIX yet
- macOS releases: sign + notarize via org secrets (Apple certs)
- Do not commit certs/passwords; use GitHub Actions secrets only
- Keep direct-download zip when adding Store packaging; MSIX is additive
